   457	## 7. Deliverables and hygiene
   458	`evidence/` (git-ignored except `*.md`), `SESSION_RESULT.md` in the fixed
   459	format of the scoping study's `RESULT.md` (provenance block; decision inputs
   460	with thresholds applied mechanically; predictions vs measurements; per-arm
   461	tables with tier validation, SDR gate, capture scope / graph verification;
   462	per-layer tables from the traces; what failed), then `LEDGER.md` (plan
   463	Phase 2). Every number cites its file; unattributable = `UNRESOLVED`.
