    11	              EAGER iff it belongs to a kernel-launch API call; UNRESOLVED
    12	              otherwise. Eager kernels are split into external input staging
    13	              (cudagraph-trees `_foreach_copy_`/multi_tensor_apply copies and
    14	              ATen direct-copy kernels) vs uncaptured model computation.
    15	Verdict `fully_graphed` requires, in EVERY pass: >= 1 graph launch, zero
    16	uncaptured model kernels, zero unresolved kernels. Anything else is reported
    17	as not fully graphed with the offending kernel names.
